  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.10: Async backend refactoring\n- NEW: Task-based async APIs on IQuantumBackend (ExecuteToStateAsync, ApplyOperationAsync) with CancellationToken\n- NEW: Async QAOA execution helpers (executeQaoaCircuitAsync, executeQaoaWithGridSearchAsync, executeWithBudgetAsync)\n- NEW: Async ML pipeline (computeKernelAsync, computeKernelMatrixAsync, predictAsync, evaluateAsync)\n- NEW: Cloud backend factory (CloudBackendFactory) for Rigetti, IonQ, Quantinuum, AtomComputing\n- NEW: UnifiedBackend async helpers (applySequenceAsync, applyWithConversionAsync)\n- NEW: OpenQASM export async (exportToFileAsync, exportToFileWithConfigAsync)\n- IMPROVED: All async methods use task {} CE (not async {}), returning Task<T> for .NET interop\n- IMPROVED: Sync methods marked [Obsolete] where async alternatives exist\n- FIXED: 6 pre-existing .fsx script failures (MathNet dependency, syntax errors)\n- Status: Production-ready",
